  "caveats": [
    "Significance uses Newey-West (HAC) t-stats: weekly dates with a multi-week horizon overlap, so the naive t roughly doubles the real confidence.",
    "TCGCSV carries presale prices, so fresh cards enter ~1-2 weeks before release and then fall hard \u2014 that decay drives most of the all-cards IC.",
    "The edge concentrates in cheap cards; above $10 it shrinks toward (but stays above) zero. Treat the mature_liquid number as the honest baseline.",
    "Universe is products that still exist on TCGplayer today (mild survivorship)."
  ]
